# SOC2/GDPR Infrastructure Skill

Review, scaffold, and audit production-grade AWS infrastructure built on the CloudDrove wrapper-module pattern — enforcing SOC2 CC6/CC7/C1/A1 and GDPR Art.5/25/32/33 controls at the code level.

## Keywords

soc2, gdpr, compliance, clouddrove, wrapper, module, aws, terraform, security, kms, guardduty, securityhub, waf, eks, aurora, elasticache, alb, acm, route53, vpc, irsa, cloudtrail, inspector, iam, github actions, ci/cd, drift

## Output Artifacts

| Request | Output |
|---------|--------|
| `/soc2-infra review` | Blocking / advisory finding list mapped to SOC2 control IDs |
| `/soc2-infra new <module>` | Complete `_modules/<name>/` scaffold: `main.tf`, `variables.tf`, `outputs.tf` |
| `/soc2-infra ci` | GitHub Actions workflow files: `terraform.yml` + `drift.yml` |
| `/soc2-infra controls` | SOC2 + GDPR control coverage gap analysis for the current repo |

